# Features: browse and preview @feature: pragmas
Output features.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontSize 18
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800

Type "cd sample-project && nvim http.lua"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type "gg"
Sleep 300ms
Type "/@feature:"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type ":DwightFeatures"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms

Enter
Sleep 2s

Sleep 3s
